I've found that teleport on the riders can be useful when they're already
adjacent to you. I use it when they're blocking a doorway. I then have a 
1/13 chance that they're teleported somewhere else, and in the best case 
an (12/13)*(5/6) = 0.77 chance that they'll end up behind me and I can jump
ahead and flee. Of course, with a very high damage output it can take as 
few as two or three hits to just kill them, so that would still be the 
better choice.

